{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689970/extras/1.gif?t=1746640187\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Effortless One-Handed Play</strong> <br>Weapons attack automatically, and the character is equipped with blink and sprint abilities, ensuring easy controls and intuitive gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soul Orb System</strong> <br>Each weapon slot comes with its own unique attributes. Combine various weapons strategically to create the perfect loadout for any situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Support Items</strong> <br>Support items affect adjacent weapons, offering countless possibilities for creative combinations. Experience both strategy and fun in every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeon Exploration</strong> <br>Beyond combat, discover exciting rooms and hidden chambers within the dungeon, adding a sense of adventure and exploration to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*This demo includes part of the content from the first stage and allows players to experience the basic systems and game design.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689970?t=1746640187","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689970/08927f95674a5afcb88ad5717f484f924022835d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746640187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689970/d7e3e8da39a7e1df88da5f64ea6c250baa75cc61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746640187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689970/d7e3e8da39a7e1df88da5f64ea6c250baa75cc61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746640187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo